[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16569.189, "timestamp": "04:36:09", "text": "妈妈，你好。你刚才说我得……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16572.109, "timestamp": "04:36:12", "text": "重点？是的，我做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16582.629, "timestamp": "04:36:22", "text": "所以，这不是正确的方法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16585.269, "timestamp": "04:36:25", "text": "我可以擅自闯入别人的房间吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16587.029, "timestamp": "04:36:27", "text": "房间？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16595.91, "timestamp": "04:36:35", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16600.551, "timestamp": "04:36:40", "text": "这应该会很有意思。清理。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16602.15, "timestamp": "04:36:42", "text": "我想有些介绍是这样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16605.59, "timestamp": "04:36:45", "text": "命令。哦，这位是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16615.91, "timestamp": "04:36:55", "text": "这是什么？有人扔了个丁丁炸弹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16618.31, "timestamp": "04:36:58", "text": "我们离开这里吧。"}]